hJiQ4Q7kNvwEmAuff&_nc_oc=AdpqrW_XHyO0223onxjUdxGzYY7OAjHm7N-IIgHRs-SsExVTlHzAGc7O5yKx6Uu6eTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwUXPrvStuHMSGXMY31UcyvAPPoLFU7q2bOHAQ67okptw&oe=69C3D4CF"}, {"file_name": "XPZ_Screenshot04.png", "id": "968014989220990", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_968014992554323_7156409964858030018_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mNd39SkmA2oQ7kNvwGGjt4r&_nc_oc=AdoZ1TyKt2945QTTg5D_ppmT_XMAqBFzF4H2QlEIatkddvRgZufcMmyNzf9gyJtQuHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyD93aXz6p0Z6nrNkt91jnQZEG4PoRXC8RxWWVwQaWn4g&oe=69C3EC61"}, {"file_name": "XPZ_Screenshot05.png", "id": "967045972505631", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821081_967045975838964_1133222401294464158_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJstKZQeJskQ7kNvwHIlbLb&_nc_oc=AdrFyD6o6yeNjdZymzWrUzoCQgxeNfM9vTx0xtYYe1Bw3eWb7exm6ErJ9ZEpGpiTANc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwRzJ98Hc9ZUvmdoHA2OySnz4kiy_OwlZb6RoqPiGTc7w&oe=69C3D1DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "XploitZERO_Key Art_Landscape.png", "id": "851391407496299", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_851391414162965_4053303436264422722_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3yuGjmUrM3oQ7kNvwGYNVF7&_nc_oc=AdoQnG7U-VdlvO9EIQl2kcEXpLPHtiuEwqC4Cwhm-VCLGrPOFZ7IjayH_A50qKzOlTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afydp_kmKcPrIOE8sMHzAOv6kN76NkT1OFsCekttra83wQ&oe=69C3BFF4"}, "display_name": "Xploit ZERO", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Fitness", "Action", "MR", "Defense"], "long_description": "Xploit ZERO is a mixed reality arcade tower-defense game where your real room becomes the battlefield. As an **XRunner**, a digital breach opens inside your space, sending viruses toward your **NeuroGate**, the anchor that keeps your connection to reality.\n\nBuild and place turrets throughout your room to stop waves of digital enemies, and jump into first-person combat to defend them.\n\n# \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Your room becomes the map\nExperience gameplay in your real environment thanks to Mixed Reality (MR).\n\n# \u2694\ufe0f Place turrets anywhere\nCollect **Memory Cores** to build your defense strategy.\n\n#  \ud83d\udc7e Fight incoming waves\nEnemies attack from multiple directions, stay alert.\n\n# \u231bFast-paced gameplay\nReact quickly and adapt your strategy in real time as the pressure increases.\n\n# \u26a1 Physical interaction\nUse your hands to build, place, and control your defenses, and engage in first-person combat against flying enemies.\n\n# \ud83c\udfae Game Modes\n**Countdown Mode**  \nA fast-paced **5-minute countdown** designed for intense arcade sessions.\n\n**Endless Mode**  \nSurvive as long as possible and chase high scores under constant pressure.\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Early Access & Community\nXploit ZERO is available in **Early Access** with **5 fully playable levels**, offering a complete experience from day one.\n\n# \u2139\ufe0f Play Space \nTo enjoy a better experience, make sure you have at least 8 ft x 8 ft (2.5 m x 2.5 m) of play space.", "short_description": "Your room is no longer safe. Defend your space. Survive the invasion.\n\nIn Xploit ZERO, your physical space becomes the battlefield.\n\nPlace turrets anywhere in your room, react in real time, and defend against waves of digital enemies breaking into your world. Move, jump, aim, and adapt as the attack intensifies; every inch matters, and your strategy determines how long you survive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.aaagamestudios.com/xploit.zero/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.aaagamestudios.com/xploit.zero/legal-notice.html", "publisher_name": "AAA Games Studios S.L.", "support_website_url": "https://www.aaagamestudios.com/xploit.zero/early-access.html", "website_